\b Question 16\b0 : Student Registration System\par
Question: Write a Dart program that declares a student's name using var, age using final, and school name using const.\par
\par
Answer:\par
void main() \{\par
  var studentName = "Chrisostome";\par
  final int age = 12;\par
  const String schoolName = "CMS UNILAK";\par
  print("STUDENT REGISTRATION INFORMATION");\par
  print("Student Name: $studentName");\par
  print("Age: $age");\par
  print("School Name: $schoolName");\par
\}\par
Expected output:\par
STUDENT REGISTRATION INFORMATION\par
Student Name: Chrisostome\par
Age: 12\par
School Name: CMS UNILAK\par
Explanation:\par
Keyword\tab Meaning\par
var\tab Automatically identifies the data type.\par
final\tab Allows a variable to be assigned only once.\par
const\tab Declares a compile-time constant.\par
String\tab Stores text.\par
int\tab Stores whole numbers.\par
print()\tab Displays information on the console\par
